{
  "//": [
    "Copy to main.<env>.parameters.json (gitignored) and fill in. There is no",
    "database password here any more: the shared PostgreSQL server has password",
    "authentication disabled, so the API authenticates with its managed identity.",
    "The only secret is the Entra sign-in client secret, and it should be passed on",
    "the command line rather than written into this file:",
    "",
    "  az deployment group create -g <rg> -f infra/main.bicep \\",
    "    -p @infra/main.dev.parameters.json -p aadClientSecret=\"$APP_SECRET\"",
    "",
    "sseUsersGroupObjectId is required in practice: getRoles fails CLOSED when it is",
    "unset, so an environment deployed without it admits nobody. That is deliberate —",
    "the alternative failure mode admits everybody."
  ],
  "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentParameters.json#",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
  "parameters": {
    "environmentName": { "value": "dev" },
    "postgresFqdn": { "value": "<shared-postgres-server>.postgres.database.azure.com" },
    "postgresDatabase": { "value": "sse" },
    "aadClientId": { "value": "<appId of the SSE sign-in registration for this environment>" },
    "sseUsersGroupObjectId": { "value": "<object id of the SSE users security group>" },
    "sseDevelopersGroupObjectId": { "value": "<object id of the group allowed to change request status>" },
    "productTag": { "value": "sse" }
  }
}
